# Global search for the command palette. Every authenticated role may call it; groups the role cannot read are null.
# Port matches launchSettings.json (http profile). Paste a bearer token from POST /api/auth/login.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token

### Search all groups (default 5 hits per group)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=novak
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### At most 2 hits per group (limit 1 to 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=fve&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
